      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/scotts_north_carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Scotts lies in the Piedmont region, its undulating terrain and mixed hardwood forests support local agriculture and creek systems feeding Lake Norman.",
